{
  "uid": "traderx-trades-per-second",
  "title": "TraderX Trades/sec — 009 vs 009b",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "refresh": "1s",
  "tags": ["traderx", "orders", "matcher", "throughput", "009-vs-009b", "provisioned"],
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": { "refresh_intervals": ["1s", "2s", "5s", "10s", "30s", "1m"] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Hero metric = Trades/sec** — each order fill books a trade to trade-service. The *same* workload produces the *same* fills in both states; the difference is **how fast they clear**:\n\n- **009** (poll / lock / inline-JPA): trades dribble out as a low line over minutes (~single/tens per sec).\n- **009b** (LMAX hot path): the same trades clear in a brief, tall spike (sub-second).\n\nBoth states use the **same ports**, so run **one at a time** and compare across runs. Grafana is served at `/grafana/` (e.g. `http://localhost:8080/grafana/`).\n\n**Ticks/sec caveat:** for **009b** this is true sequenced input-event throughput (~10k–25k/s). For **009** it is only the **1 Hz scheduled poll** — 009 exposes no per-price-tick counter, so read **Trades/sec** for 009's effective throughput.\n\n> Tip: to watch 009b as a sustained line instead of a blip, drive a larger workload so its run lasts several seconds. The `order-matcher` scrape job runs at **1s** to capture the burst."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Trades/sec (now)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(irate(traderx_order_events_total{event=~\"fill|partial_fill|force_fill\"}[30s]))" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 1, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Peak trades/sec (window)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(irate(traderx_order_events_total{event=~\"fill|partial_fill|force_fill\"}[30s]))" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["max"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "decimals": 1, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } } }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total fills (trades booked)",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(traderx_order_events_total{event=~\"fill|partial_fill|force_fill\"})" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 } }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Open orders",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "max(traderx_orders_open_total)" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0 } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Trades per second (fills booked)",
      "description": "Rate of order fills (each fill = one trade booked to trade-service). 009 = low line over minutes; 009b = brief tall spike. Same total fills in both states.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(irate(traderx_order_events_total{event=~\"fill|partial_fill|force_fill\"}[30s]))", "legendFormat": "trades/sec (total)" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (event) (irate(traderx_order_events_total{event=~\"fill|partial_fill|force_fill\"}[30s]))", "legendFormat": "{{event}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "cps",
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" }
        },
        "overrides": [
          { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "trades/sec (total)" }, "properties": [ { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 3 }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } } ] }
        ]
      },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Order submits (acks)/sec",
      "description": "Rate of accepted order create events (POST /orders).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(irate(traderx_order_events_total{event=\"create\"}[30s]))", "legendFormat": "submits/sec" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Matcher ticks/sec  (009b: input events · 009: 1 Hz poll)",
      "description": "009b: sequenced input events processed by the BLP (true matcher throughput, ~10k–25k/s under load). 009: scheduled poll cadence only (~1/s) — 009 has no per-price-tick counter, so use Trades/sec for 009's real throughput.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 19 },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "irate(traderx_order_matcher_ticks_total[30s])", "legendFormat": "ticks/sec" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineInterpolation": "smooth", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never" } } },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["max"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "single" } }
    }
  ]
}
